WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:05.720
Hey team it’s Charlie and Agents of SHIELD
just came roaring back, so this is going to

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.750
be my top 10 video from episode 1.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.599
Thanks everyone that tweeted at me during
the broadcast.

00:00:09.599 --> 00:00:14.040
I’m going to try and live tweet as many
shows as possible but I can usually only do

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.820
for one show per night.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.759
Since this is the first video of the season
I’ll make some Marvel related announcements

00:00:19.759 --> 00:00:21.359
at the end of the video.

00:00:21.359 --> 00:00:24.460
Okay, so TOP 10 Moments from the episode,
careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:25.460
it yet.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.769
I’ll wait just a sec...okay, here we go.

00:00:28.769 --> 00:00:31.669
Number 10 - Haley Atwell and the Howling Commandos

00:00:31.669 --> 00:00:35.620
The Agent Carter flashback was intended to
bookend the mystery object plot.

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:40.079
That’s going to be the first major plot
that will cover this half of the season.

00:00:40.079 --> 00:00:44.800
The other, less obvious reason they did the
Agent Carter flashback was to promo the Agent

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.309
Carter TV Series that’s premiering in January.

00:00:47.309 --> 00:00:49.800
That show will air when SHIELD goes on break.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:53.559
So far there are only 4 episodes of Agent
Carter planned.

00:00:53.559 --> 00:01:00.089
Since it’s airing during SHIELD’s timeslot
while it’s on break, if Agent Carter gets

00:01:00.089 --> 00:01:03.710
picked up for a full season it’s possible
they’d reschedule it to another night so

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:05.950
they could run both shows at the same time.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:12.650
But until we hear otherwise, Agent Carter
in January.

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:15.620
And yes, Haley Atwell is doing all the episodes.

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:20.040
Dominic West is coming back to play Howard
Stark and they just cast the real life human

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:25.430
version of JARVIS, the man that inspired Tony
Stark’s Artificial Intelligence.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:28.140
Number 9 - Skye is a full time agent now

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:32.240
This is going to be both very cool and very
funny at times.

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:36.130
Skye is still the rookie but now she gets
to be a part of the action in a way she wasn’t

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:37.340
in season 1.

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:38.340
She gets to play with all the fun toys.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:49.140
Toys that are supposed to help her decode
the Kree or Inhuman code.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:55.480
I asked people on twitter what they thought
during this scene and Kree is the leading

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:56.480
theory right now.

00:01:56.480 --> 00:02:00.650
But I’m trying to keep my mind open to Inhumans
or some other marvel verse alien tech.

00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:04.530
That’s going to be the second major running
plot.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:11.310
So we’re up to 2 now, The 0-8-4 device and
the kree symbols.

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.620
Number 8 - Fitz goes crazy

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:18.230
It took till the end of the episode for us
to see that he had been hallucinating Ward

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:19.480
for the entire episode.

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:23.870
In the beginning she wasn’t there either,
he was the only one talking to her.

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:28.170
What happened was in the finale last year
his brain was injured when Ward dropped them

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:29.590
into the ocean.

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:32.780
As a result he’s not able to function on
a normal level.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:34.560
I think a couple of things could happen with
this.

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:39.569
Either he’ll do something crazy to try and
fix himself, like take some mystery kree blood

00:02:39.569 --> 00:02:44.090
or whatever Coulson and Skye took at TAHITI
or some other miracle fix.

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:47.210
Some how he will be made whole by the end
of the season, but he’s going to have to

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:48.210
change.

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:53.210
I’m not expecting him to get crazy cybernetic
implants, I think it will be more of a personality

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.210
change.

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.810
So I’m really looking forward to watching
that unfold.

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:59.640
Number 7 - The Playground is the new headquarters

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:01.410
This whole place will be like their big standing
set.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:02.410
This office.

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:04.260
It’s so they don’t get stuck shooting
on the bus all season.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:06.130
It’s just a way for them to keep things
fresh.

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:08.500
I like the old school analog look.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:18.870
Number 6 - I don’t think Patton Oswalt 
is going to be in all the episodes this season,

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:21.280
but he will be in the episodes that take place
at the Playground.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.390
He was a lot of fun in the episode.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:27.069
I’m happy that they let his character be
a part of the action.

00:03:27.069 --> 00:03:31.599
Patton Oswalt is one of those rare people
that’s really quick and has a vast knowledge

00:03:31.599 --> 00:03:32.630
of Marvel Canon.

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:39.099
So I think it’s much easier for him to exist
as an actor in those types of stories.

00:03:39.099 --> 00:03:41.270
Most people only know him as a comedian but
he has also been working in Hollywood as a

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:44.680
screenwriter for a long time.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:47.580
He gets brought in a lot of times to make
movies funnier.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:04:00.910
He’s a great writer, so I’m interested
to see if he does any writing on Agents of

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:03.440
SHIELD in the future

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:09.099
Number 5 - Absorbing Man aka Crusher Creel

00:04:09.099 --> 00:04:11.750
I believe he’s going to be in the first
two episodes at least.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:15.630
It feels like there are too many opportunities
for them to have fun with the character to

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.530
get rid of him forever.

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:24.830
I really liked that they didn’t let him
talk.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.479
One, he’s more threatening that way.

00:04:27.479 --> 00:04:30.620
And two, it gives them the opportunity to
make him more sympathetic later.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.759
We don’t really know anything about him
other than the brief notes they read on him

00:04:33.759 --> 00:04:35.370
in the episode.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:38.990
Clearly he’s working for Kraken so it’s
possible he’s in a Deathlok type situation

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:41.550
where Kraken is forcing him to help him.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:46.710
As for his powers.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:53.870
In the comics he got his powers when Loki
gave him a special potion that would allow

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:54.870
him to absorb other people’s powers.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.069
Loki was going to use him to defeat thor.

00:04:56.069 --> 00:04:59.580
Thor beat him by turning the ground around
crusher into helium with a hammer strike and

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:00.580
he turned into helium and floated harmlessly
away.

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:01.580
Let that be the lesson.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:05.009
I’m interested to see if SHIELD uses absorbing
man’s powers against him.

00:05:05.009 --> 00:05:09.680
Like getting him to absorb something that
immobilizes him.

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:16.319
I loved that moment at the end where he turned
his hand into rubber to pick up the alien

00:05:16.319 --> 00:05:17.319
device.

00:05:17.319 --> 00:05:19.939
That was comic book nerd logic right there.

00:05:19.939 --> 00:05:23.229
Number 4 - Ward is on Ice in the Playground
and Informing on HYDRA

00:05:23.229 --> 00:05:27.169
I think a couple of things are going on here,
one he’s trying to get out just because

00:05:27.169 --> 00:05:28.169
he hates the cell.

00:05:28.169 --> 00:05:32.479
Two, he still has feelings for Skye and three
he wants to hurt someone just as a way to

00:05:32.479 --> 00:05:33.969
deal with his problems.

00:05:33.969 --> 00:05:35.279
So why not hurt HYDRA.

00:05:35.279 --> 00:05:49.309
He’s really not loyal to anyone right now,
he’s like the lone wolf.

00:05:49.309 --> 00:05:57.599
They did have a hannibal lecter thing going
on with Skye.

00:05:57.599 --> 00:06:01.830
I thought the creepy way he was talking was
almost a little too much, but when those two

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:05.319
are together all I can think about is the
meta skyward ‘ship narrative.

00:06:05.319 --> 00:06:10.270
It’s like the actual text of the scene doesn’t
matter, it’s all about the subtext.

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:14.669
Most of the time I focus on the actual plot
and what’s going on in episodes, but sometimes

00:06:14.669 --> 00:06:15.689
it’s fun to examine subtext.

00:06:15.689 --> 00:06:17.369
Which is where tumblr comes in.

00:06:17.369 --> 00:06:18.369
Skye and Ward together are like Tumblr Gold.

00:06:18.369 --> 00:06:25.039
He’s going to go on like this till someone
breaks him out, he escapes or they let him

00:06:25.039 --> 00:06:26.039
out.

00:06:26.039 --> 00:06:27.279
I think he’ll be back on the team eventually.

00:06:27.279 --> 00:06:30.969
Brett Dalton will continue to be a main cast
member, so there are only a few things they

00:06:30.969 --> 00:06:34.869
can do with the character that will allow
them to feature him in all the episodes.

00:06:34.869 --> 00:06:41.219
And I don’t see him going all bad.

00:06:41.219 --> 00:06:45.569
My early prediction is that by the end of
the season he will have mostly redeemed himself

00:06:45.569 --> 00:06:54.930
to Team Coulson.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.850
Number 3 - Lucy Lawless Agent of SHIELD

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:00.839
It’s hard to tell right now what they’re
intending to do with her character.

00:07:00.839 --> 00:07:04.969
They wouldn’t have cast such a notable person
to make her a redshirt.

00:07:04.969 --> 00:07:06.240
This is what I think is going on.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:10.649
The Alien Device will do something to change
her, but because of the car crash and cutting

00:07:10.649 --> 00:07:13.939
her hand off, she’ll be stuck in a coma
or something for several episodes.

00:07:13.939 --> 00:07:25.100
Then they might bring her back for the mid
season finale with special powers or something.

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:30.569
It just feels like they were very clearly
setting her character up for a big reveal

00:07:30.569 --> 00:07:31.869
and we just haven’t seen the reveal yet.

00:07:31.869 --> 00:07:32.869
If they weren’t planning on doing something
like that, they would have just cast an actual

00:07:32.869 --> 00:07:33.869
red-shirt actor.

00:07:33.869 --> 00:07:34.869
Someone that was half the cost, Lucy Lawless
does not come cheap.

00:07:34.869 --> 00:07:35.960
So for now, just keep your eyes peeled on
her.

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.909
Isabelle Hartley isn’t someone from the
comics.

00:07:37.909 --> 00:07:42.610
So I’m thinking they just gave her that
name to throw us off the scent and they’ll

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:45.539
turn her into someone from the comics.

00:07:45.539 --> 00:07:47.949
Number 2 - Hydra is still everywhere

00:07:47.949 --> 00:07:51.050
Pay very close attention to this map of HYDRA
cells.

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:54.379
Those aren’t just people, they’re bases
full of people.

00:07:54.379 --> 00:07:58.680
This is the backdoor teaser for Avengers 2
Age of Ultron.

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:01.180
During that movie, they’re going to be dealing
with all those.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:03.599
The Avengers are.

00:08:03.599 --> 00:08:08.990
The reason Tony Stark creates Ultron is because
there are too many HYDRA cells for them to

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:09.990
deal with.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:13.689
Thus he pulls an old peace keeping program
out of mothballs.

00:08:13.689 --> 00:08:17.679
Upgrades it and puts it into the body of one
of his modified Iron Man Suits.

00:08:17.679 --> 00:08:21.050
That’s where Ultron comes from in Avengers
2.

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:29.229
He’s created because of all these HYDRA
dots on the map.

00:08:29.229 --> 00:08:32.210
Of course that’s where things go south in
a hurry and he starts his mission to kill

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:33.210
the entire human race.

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:35.500
You know how it goes with rogue AI…

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:41.579
And my number 1 moment - Intro Big Bad of
the season Dr Whitehall played by Reed Diamond

00:08:41.579 --> 00:08:45.270
You might remember him from Joss Whedon’s
Much Ado About Nothing, he was also on Dollhouse.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.990
He’s a long time whedonverse veteran.

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:53.160
He started out as a HYDRA agent but in present
day he’s also going to take on the persona

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:55.130
of Kraken from the comic books.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.440
Daniel Whitehall is the characters name.

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:03.490
He has special armor with this really trippy
helmet that has a will of it’s own.

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:10.000
He’s very much the big bad of the season
and introducing him in the first episode,

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:13.839
the first moments of the first episode was
one of the best things I think they could

00:09:13.839 --> 00:09:14.839
have done.

00:09:14.839 --> 00:09:19.220
It’s a lot easier for people to follow a
show if they know who the villain is.

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:23.230
We got to see Bill Paxton put on crazy centipede
armor last year in the finale.

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:27.190
So I’m betting that we’ll get to see Doctor
Whitehall in the Kraken Armor eventually.

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:31.940
Now it’s your turn, let me know what your
favorite moment was and what do you think

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:33.980
of the main villain so far?

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:37.570
Overall this episode was a solid A as far
as premiere’s go.

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:42.130
I feel like this is the type of episode everyone
was expecting given the amazingness of the

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:44.330
last half of season 1.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:48.170
The established a clear villain for us to
root against in the first moments of the episode,

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:53.460
introduced us to at least 3 major plots and
all the new character arcs.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:57.370
I’m really happy with the challenges they’re
giving to all the characters, It’s very

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:58.930
Wizard of Oz.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:03.930
Fitz has to fix his brain, Skye and Ward are
like the tin man, they have to fix their heart.

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:08.640
Coulson has to deal with HYDRA and Kraken
and there’s this shadow of alien code all

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:11.180
around them.

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:34.110
This is going to be a really fun season.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:37.629
Since Arrow isn’t back yet, I’ll totally
do a Q&amp;A for this tomorrow morning.

00:10:37.629 --> 00:10:38.800
So write all your questions in the comments.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:41.959
If you’re just finding me for the first
time and you like to talk about Marvel stuff

00:10:41.959 --> 00:10:44.519
please subscribe and join the team, we’d
love to have you.

00:10:44.519 --> 00:10:59.350
We’ll be meeting every Tuesday night.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:09.980
So right now click here for that Q&amp;A, I’ll
add the annotation tomorrow when I post it

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:13.779
and click here for my top 10 moments from
the Gotham Premiere.

00:11:13.779 --> 00:11:19.741
Thanks for watching, now let’s all high
five and meet back up tomorrow for round 2.

